('02','来自裂隙的召唤','冒险召唤',9.828,19.236,'A wide frontal composition of a towering black concrete wall with one hairline vertical golden slit. A single crimson ribbon lies across the dark floor and points toward the slit. Low eye level, ribbon foreground, monolithic wall background.','Same composition and objects. The vertical slit has opened just enough to cast a slender warm beam onto the ribbon. The ribbon tip rises toward the beam while the rest trails on the floor.','The slit of warm light slowly widens and the ribbon tip rises toward it. A very slow push forward, no camera rotation.'),
