('04','水中的路','指引',24.035,28.834,'A low wide view across a shallow obsidian pool inside the concrete hall. One crimson ribbon tip hovers just above the water. A single thin golden reflection runs across the water toward a distant doorway.','Same pool and camera. The same silk tip has touched the water, producing one elegant concentric ripple; the golden reflection continues through the ripple toward the doorway.','The ribbon tip touches the water once and a concentric ripple expands. Hold the doorway and reflection stable. No new objects.'),
