('06','无尽阶梯','试炼',33.634,40.528,'An impossible but geometrically clean monumental concrete staircase suspended above a dark void. A single crimson silk ribbon lies along the first few stairs and leads upward. Wide oblique view, tall architectural scale, soft haze.','Same staircase and camera position. The leading tip of the ribbon has climbed several steps toward a small warm light above; the trailing fabric remains draped on the lower steps.','The ribbon slowly climbs the steps like a current of air drawing it upward. The staircase remains rigid and stable. One slow upward camera drift.'),
('07','镜廊','逼近深处',40.528,47.722,'A long concrete corridor with dark mirror panels and a single crimson ribbon hovering down its center. Reflections create restrained repeating red echoes but there is only one physical ribbon. A distant dark doorway.','Same corridor, camera and ribbon. The ribbon has advanced toward the doorway; its mirror echoes grow darker and less distinct while a faint gold seam is visible beyond.','The ribbon advances along the corridor, reflections moving coherently with it. One slow forward dolly. No additional physical ribbons or characters.'),
('08','悬于深渊','磨难',47.722,52.531,'A massive concrete slab floats over a black abyss, seen in a wide low-angle composition. A single crimson silk ribbon is stretched across the gap between two rigid stone edges. Dim top light, immense negative space.','Same stone edges, abyss and camera. The ribbon bows downward into the void, still one continuous piece, lit along its red edge by a very faint gold light below.','The ribbon slowly bows downward under an invisible weight. The stone architecture stays still. Build tension without breaking the ribbon into random fragments.'),
('09','归零','死亡与放下',52.531,57.619,'In the dark abyss, one continuous crimson ribbon is curled into a compact suspended cocoon-like spiral. A tiny dim golden point sits inside the coil. Close wide cinematic composition with deep black negative space.','Same camera and continuous red silk cocoon. The spiral has tightened slightly around the now brighter small golden core; no explosion yet, the surrounding darkness remains absolute.','The silk coil slowly tightens and the tiny golden core brightens. Hold the dramatic release for the next shot; no cut, no explosion.'),
('10','破茧','重生',57.619,64.823,'The compact red silk cocoon floats at the center of a vast dark concrete chamber, a bright pale-gold core visible through its folds. Symmetrical wide composition, expectant stillness.','Same chamber, camera and single continuous ribbon. The cocoon has unfurled into one sweeping wing-like silk arc around the brilliant gold core, with a shaft of light reaching upward. Abstract fabric only, not a literal bird or angel.','The red silk cocoon unfurls into a broad graceful arc as the golden core reveals itself. This is the strongest release in the film. Keep one connected piece of fabric and stable architecture.'),
('11','穿环而上','回归之路',64.823,72.026,'Looking upward through three enormous concentric concrete rings suspended in a luminous grey void. One crimson ribbon rises through the central axis as a gentle helix, its tip below the upper ring. Monumental scale.','Same rings, camera and ribbon. The silk tip has ascended beyond the upper ring into pale gold light, the continuous lower ribbon still threading the rings.','The ribbon ascends smoothly through the rings. Very slow upward camera movement, rigid rings, connected fabric, no sudden cuts.'),
('12','飞升','最终转化',72.026,77.424,'An immense crimson silk arc floats above a quiet grey cloud horizon and a distant flat black monolith. A small pale gold sun-like light is partly veiled by the fabric. Wide awe-inspiring minimal composition.','Same horizon, monolith and fabric. The silk arc has lifted to reveal the pale gold light completely; the red cloth catches the light along its long edge, monumental and calm.','The broad silk arc rises and reveals the warm light. A deliberate graceful release, with a subtle push forward. Keep the horizon and monolith still.'),
